        },
        {
          "text": "Cogo kom Yucepu ma onoŋo jo Icrael yam gukelo ki i Ejipt giyiko i Cekem i dullobo ma yam Yakobo owilo ki bot awobe pa Kamor ma won Cekem; owilo ki dullim miya acel. Dul lobo-nu odoko ginaleya pa likwayo pa Yucepu matwal’",
